# Copy to .env and fill in. Nothing is required yet.
# TTS provider used by `pnpm tts` when --provider is not given: fake | edge (default: fake).
#   fake = silent WAV for dev/tests; edge = free Microsoft Edge voices via the edge-tts Python package (no API key).
# TTS_PROVIDER=fake
# edge provider: Python interpreter (default: <repo>/.venv/bin/python).
# Setup: python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r pipeline/tts/providers/requirements.txt
# EDGE_TTS_PYTHON=.venv/bin/python
# edge provider: default voice when --voice is not given (default: vi-VN-HoaiMyNeural).
# EDGE_TTS_VOICE=vi-VN-HoaiMyNeural
